# Reviewed Trivy misconfiguration findings that do not apply here.

# ConfigMap holds only non-secret settings (log level, port, demo data seed).
# Trivy flags the words "SEED"/"PORT" heuristically. Real secrets go in Key Vault.
KSV-01010

